{% comment %}
================================================================================
BW Browse Abandon — Recently Browsed Products Grid
================================================================================
PASTE AS: HTML block in Braze drag-and-drop editor (Browse Abandon canvas steps)
PLACE:    Replaces the single-product module in the current BW browse abandon email

READS: custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products}
  Written by "BW - Track Browse Products" webhook canvas.
  Fields used: product_id, product_title, image_url, url

BEHAVIOR:
  - Up to 8 products, newest first (array stored oldest-first → reversed here)
  - Aborts the email message if the attribute is empty (user has no browse history)
  - Each product renders as its own table with #681818 background; the gap between
    cards acts as the visual separator — no explicit dividers needed

MESSAGE_EXTRAS:
  Sets "browsed_product_ids" = comma-separated shopify_product_ids of all
  rendered products. Captured in Snowflake:
    BRAZE_BRAZEWEST_BRAZE_RAW_EVENTS_AWS_US_EAST_1_XJ24206
    .DATALAKE_SHARING.USERS_MESSAGES_EMAIL_SEND_SHARED.MESSAGE_EXTRAS
  Use for purchase attribution: join sends → USERS_BEHAVIORS_PURCHASE_SHARED
  on USER_ID within a 7-day window.

BRANDING: Burrow — Arial, #383633 text, #F4F3F1 card bg, #681818 outer bg
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% assign products_all = custom_attribute.${recently_browsed_products} | default: empty %}
{% assign products = products_all | reverse | slice: 0, 8 %}

{% comment %} ── Abort if no browse history ───────────────────────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% if products.size == 0 %}
  {% abort_message('no recently browsed products') %}
{% endif %}

{% comment %} ── MESSAGE_EXTRAS: all rendered product IDs ─────────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign browsed_ids = '' %}
{% for product in products %}
  {% if browsed_ids == '' %}
    {% assign browsed_ids = product.product_id | default: '' %}
  {% else %}
    {% assign browsed_ids = browsed_ids | append: ',' | append: product.product_id %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if browsed_ids != blank %}
  {%- message_extras :key "browsed_product_ids" :value "{{ browsed_ids }}" -%}
{% endif %}

{% for product in products %}
{% assign img   = product.image_url     | default: '' %}
{% assign url   = product.url           | default: '' %}
{% assign title = product.product_title | default: 'View Product' %}
{% assign pad_top = '20px' %}
{% assign pad_bot = '20px' %}
{% if forloop.first %}{% assign pad_top = '0px' %}{% endif %}
{% if forloop.last  %}{% assign pad_bot = '0px' %}{% endif %}

<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:600px; background-color:#681818;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:{{ pad_top }} 0px {{ pad_bot }} 0px;">

      <!-- White Product Card -->
      <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="90%" style="max-width:542px; background-color:#F4F3F1; border-radius:10px;">
        <tr>
          <td align="center" style="padding:50px 0px 50px 0px;">

            <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">

              <!-- Product Image -->
              <tr>
                <td align="center" style="text-align:center; padding:0 0 15px 0;">
                  <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ url }}">
                    <img alt="{{ title | escape }}" width="430" src="{{ img }}" border="0"
                         style="display:block; border:0; width:100%; max-width:430px; height:auto; margin:0 auto; background-color:#F4F3F1; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:11px; color:#383633;">
                  </a>
                </td>
              </tr>

              <!-- Product Name -->
              <tr>
                <td align="center" style="text-align:center; padding:0;">
                  <h2 style="padding:0; margin:0; text-align:center; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-weight:normal; font-size:24px; line-height:28px; letter-spacing:-0.3px;">
                    <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ url }}" style="text-decoration:none; color:#383633;">
                      <span style="border-bottom:1px solid #383633;">{{ title }}</span>
                    </a>
                  </h2>
                </td>
              </tr>

            </table>

          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

{% endfor %}
